"Header ko update karo:

Right side par sirf 'Search Bar' aur 'Open TOC' button bahar rakho.

Ek 'Three-Dot' (Kebab Menu) dropdown button add karo.

Dropdown ke andar ye options hone chahiye: Dark/Light Mode toggle, Language selector, Reset Progress (completed topics), Font Size control, aur 'Report Issue' ka link.

Dropdown ka design minimalist aur clean hona chahiye, jaise modern web apps mein hota hai (e.g., Shadcn/UI dropdown style).

'Search Bar' ko Ctrl+K shortcut ke sath link karo. Header ka design responsive ho aur mobile par dropdown sahi se expand hona chahiye."

yeh b 
G bilkul, yeh dynamic header resizing (scroll down karne par header ka chhota ho jana) aur bhi zyada professional lagta hai! Ise "shrinking header" ya "compact header" kehte hain.

Jab user page par upar hota hai, toh header apne full size (normal padding/height) mein hota hai. Lekin jaise hi user thoda sa bhi neeche scroll karta hai, header smooth transition ke sath compact (chhoti patti) ho jata hai, aur scroll up karne par wapis apni original size mein aa jata hai.